<rb>父</rb><rt>とと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27491-27554">の無いのは犬の子だってぶつから痛いよ。オヽ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27554-27578"><rb>道理</rb><rt>もっとも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27578-27605">じゃと抱き寄すれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27605-27620"><rb>其</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27620-27635"><rb>儘</rb><rt>まま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27635-27641">すや</seg><choice source="#source-27641-27647"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-27647-27650">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27650-27665"><rb>睡</rb><rt>ねむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27665-27710">るいじらしさ、アヽ死なれぬ身の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27710-27731"><rb>疾病</rb><rt>やまい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27731-27734">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27734-27749"><rb>是</rb><rt>これ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27749-27792">ほどなさけなき者あろうか。</seg></p>
