          <head n="2" source="#source-61077-61212"><seg source="#source-61098-61104">下　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61104-61122"><rb>弱</rb><rt>よわき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61122-61125">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61125-61143"><rb>施</rb><rt>ほどこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61143-61149">すに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61149-61182"><rb>能以無畏</rb><rt>のういむい</rt></ruby></head>
        </div>
