19168-119198">顔を、心配相に横から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119198-119213"><rb>覗</rb><rt>のぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119213-119246">き込めば見られてすまし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119246-119261"><rb>難</rb><rt>がた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119261-119282">く其眼を邪見に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119282-119297"><rb>蓋</rb><rt>ふた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119297-119366">せんとする平手、それを握りて、離さぬが悪いかと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119366-119396"><rb>男詞</rb><rt>おとこことば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119396-119399">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119399-119414"><rb>後</rb><rt>あと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119414-119417">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119417-119444"><rb>協音</rb><rt>きょうおん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119444-119447">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119447-119465"><rb>笑</rb><rt>わらい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119465-119480"><rb>計</rb><rt>ばか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119480-119489">り残る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119489-119507"><rb>睦</rb><rt>むつま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119507-119522">じき中に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119522-119552"><rb>娘々</rb><rt>むすめむすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119552-119564">と子爵の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119564-119632"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-93-39" source="#source-119564-119611">鏽</g><seg source="#source-119611-119614">声</seg></rb><rt>さびごえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119632-119635">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119635-119647"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119647-119662"><rb>覚</rb><rt>さむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-119662-119668">れば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-119668-119689"><rb>昨宵</rb><rt>ゆうべ</rt></ruby><ruby type